Z||000017||FieroLisa||08-23-2001||05:02 PM||||This computer SUCKS!! Right when I was about to reply to this post, the dang internet crashed. I had to wait 20 min til someone got here, and that's whenI went on lunch and now I'm back to the boredom.<BR>Anywho...lemme tell ya about the people here! omigod!! I went to this "US Bistro" for lunch (mall food court) and they had 3 different kinds of soups, and offered me samples...when they handed it to me they said "Its hot"...then they were like "We just said that so we could see you blow on it" Oh geeeeeeez. Men.<P>Anyway, Songman you are so right about Cricket- once you add things that are considered normal on a mobile (call ID, voicemail) it turns out to be more than the cheapest plan we offer. Ah well. <P>I do think the Nextel 2 way thing is awesome, I think we are gonna offer that one of these days? <P><BR>WOOOO HOOO I SOLD A PHONE, BE BACK!<p>[This message has been edited by FieroLisa (edited 08-23-2001).]||||reg||1
