Z||000023||FieroLisa||08-23-2001||07:37 PM||||The funny thing is they say stuff like " I just wanna be your friend" as if that's gonna fool me. When I worked at the busy store I had a guy come in, I gave him the whole sales talk and he left to "think about it" About a half hour later I get a call and this guy says "uhh yah you remember that guy that just came in with the dreds? Yah that was me, and I just wanted to say, you know, that yo' pretty and I wanna be yo' friend"  Ummmm, no.  THEN I sold a phone to a pakistinian truck driver. I usually mention to people that I live in Ohio, not NC where I am now (esp the ones that ask me out) So anyway the guy calls me on the phone and says "Are you in Ohio yet, cause I'm in Pennsylvania and I just wanted to know if we could be friends? Don't worry I won't harm you, I just want to be your friend, can I have your number? Will you call me" Ummm, once again, no.||||reg||1
