Z||000063||Ken Wittlief||08-27-2001||09:22 AM||||how to scare off guy:<P>"Can we be friends?"<P>1. One of the conditions of my parole is I cant be alone with a guy, you know, cause of what I did to my husband.<P>2. Im a: A. Nun, B. Hare Krishna, C. Mormon, D. Jehovas witness... and Im not allowed to date outside my religion. Ill have to get permission from my priest/bagwan/spirt guide - are you free to meet with him Sunday morning?<P>3. Ok but I have to tell you right up front, Im a guy!<P>4. Ill be your friend! Do you love me? how much do you love me? are you willing to die for me? are you willing to die for me soon? like tonight?<P>5. Im pregnant<P>6. Ok but I should warn you, have you ever heard of a medical disorder known as 'Praying Manthis Syndrome?<P>7...<P>  BTW I know what its like to have a boring job - I was a drill press operator once - that was boring<P>  I worked on the construction of the Chunnel - that was boring<P>  worked on an oil derrick...<P>  I was a dentist for a while... mostly boring but at least people smiled at me a lot.<P>  in a previous life I was an earthworm||||reg||10
