Z||000152||Formula88||11-28-2001||03:48 PM||||Well, my rant from work for the day...<P>Yesterday, they had me running like mad to get this program installed by close of business yesterday.  The install literally only takes about 5 minutes (if I have the user's id/password), but a bit longer cuz I've gotta get them to log in a few times.  But it's still pretty fast - and even though I had a number of them to do, I got them all done by 5.  Yeah me!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  <P>So, today, they give me a 10 page document of "testing procedures" for this application.  Now I have to go back to everyone I did yesterday and do this "test" to make sure it's working properly.  Nevermind the fact that they are using the program ok.  <P>So a 15 minute program install (with user logging in, etc.) now also requires about a 30 minute test for each and every user.  Bleck!  And I thought I was getting caught up!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif">||||reg||1
