Z||000158||FieroMaster88||11-29-2001||03:56 PM||||If you think work is boring..try my safety and first aid class.  What a joke.  You know the class is bad when the instructor ask's people not to fall asleep during lecture.  <P>Tuesday in that class we were discussing sudden illness and fainting.  A girl who had been sick with the flu passed out as she got up to go use the restroom.  The instructor stops lecturing, says ooh crap and tells someone to go get help!  Then she just kind of stood there.  A couple people in the class got up to help her out.  The instructor is the one who is supposed to be teaching us how to care for someone in that situation.....and what does she do....she stands there.  What a joke!<P>Well, have fun at work.  I have to go bleed my clutch on the Fiero AGAIN!!  Then I have class at 6.  How fun  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">||||reg||1
